# Caddy in front of the gateway: automatic HTTPS for the control socket and a wildcard certificate for the previews.
# The wildcard needs the DNS challenge, so build Caddy with your DNS provider's module (https://caddy.community/t/how-to-use-dns-provider-modules-in-caddy-2/8148)
# DNS: A records for  sandbox.example.com  and  *.sbx.example.com  -> this server.
sandbox.example.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
*.sbx.example.com {
	tls {
		dns cloudflare {env.CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN}
	}
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
